{"title":"Gold Ring","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 43)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 43 <span class=\"muted\">(934 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-ring\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/c3c47c7d52fc4a32538b.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Ring</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-ring\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/51ba16d8271a434b0934.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Ring</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-ring\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/2554864efd32db692f46.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Ring</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/264420239c726a73de34.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Bar</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/dcc4822459dc335e418a.svg\" alt=\"Gold Ring\"></div><h3>Gold Ring</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 43</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}